<article class="post"><h1 class="post-title">Akshar: Indic Keyboard</h1>
<div class="content">
<p>Akshar is my iOS keyboard for Indian languages. Type the way it sounds in English, and watch the words appear in Hindi, Tamil, Bengali &mdash; twenty-one languages in all, covering every major Indian script and a few rarely seen ones.</p>
<p>Everything runs on-device. No tracking, no data leaving your iPhone or iPad.</p>
<p><a href="https://akshar.site">Learn more at akshar.site</a> &middot; <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6759032352">Download on the App Store</a></p>
